			<Text>球戯を得意とするマヤの伝説的な英雄。死と冥府の征服者として知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_MAUI_NAME" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>マウイ</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_MAUI_DESCRIPTION" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>ポリネシア神话に登场する半神の英雄。数々の伟业と人间への赠り物で知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_MULAN_NAME" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>ムーラン</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_MULAN_DESCRIPTION" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>溢れんばかりの热意と卓越した技量を兼ね备えた女戦士。献身と忠义で知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_OYA_NAME" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>オヤ</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_OYA_DESCRIPTION" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>风と岚と稲妻の女神。激しい力で知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_SINBAD_NAME" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>シンドバッド</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_SINBAD_DESCRIPTION" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>[COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]海の英雄。[ENDCOLOR]富を求めた冒険者。奇妙で不思议な旅の数々で知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_WUKONG_NAME" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>孙悟空</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_WUKONG_DESCRIPTION" Language="ja_JP">
			<Text>斉天大聖の异名を持つ猿の王。ずる贤さと不死身の体で知られる。</Text>
		</Replace>

		
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_NANA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Nana Hiiragi</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_NANA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				Transfer student into a class for "Talented" students, renowned for her excellence at observation, reasoning, and planning.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_CHITO_YUURI_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Chito &amp; Yuuri</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_CHITO_YUURI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Lonely girls navigating in the ruins of civilization, renowned for their journey with the Kettenkrad.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_MAPLE_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Maple</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_MAPLE_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Curious player who don't want to get hurt, renowned for her defense. 
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_KOMORI_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Shuri Komori</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_KOMORI_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Girl that can't decline requests, renowned for her helpfulness.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_CLARISSA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Clarissa Bernhard</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_CLARISSA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>English outlaw who grown up in Japan, renowned for her dangerous deeds.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_ANDY_LAW_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Andy Law</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_ANDY_LAW_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				Known as Little Boy and the King of Death is the main protagonist and the anti-hero of the famous Crazy Flasher series.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_REMEDY_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Princess Remedy</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_REMEDY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				Graduated from Saturnian Healing School, uses his powers to heal inhabitants and defeat enemies.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_LEE_HUANG_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Huang Lee</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_LEE_HUANG_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				The rich son of Hong Kong. Member of Liberty City triad.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_SEKIRO_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Sekiro</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_SEKIRO_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				A disgraced and bruised shinobi, a warrior saved from the brink of death.
			</Text>
		</Row>
		
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_HERO_FLACS_NANA_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
